{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51931","headline":"醮坛峯 · 程太虚","name":"醮坛峯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苍松老桧拥华坛，鹤唳猿啼白昼闲。\n烟篆香残凌汉表，风飘仙乐响山间。\n高烧华岳金莲炬，齐到黄冈玉笋班。\n独步苍苔寻故址，恍然咫尺觐天颜。\n（以上《古今图书集成·职方典》六○二《顺庆府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"程太虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}